 "summary": "Hardware construction language embedded in Scala, from UC Berkeley and now CHIPS Alliance. Scala programs act as circuit generators that elaborate to FIRRTL, which the CIRCT-based firtool lowers to Verilog; used for RISC-V cores such as Rocket and BOOM.",
 "status": "active",
 "defined_by": [
